ial effects for  inflammation it's wonderful for sleep  the problem of course is to be careful  with the addictive potential of it and  also most of the research shows that in  folks who are generally about under the  age of 18 there's a deleterious impact  on mental function cognitive function uh  you know uh brain matter et cetera so be  super careful if you're young but  there's there's not a whole lot of  issues with moderated cannabis use kind  of like alcohol for adults and even  exercising adults who need it for kind  of like the pain killing or the focus  effect  and then as far as the plant medicine  piece  look like i i think there's a ton of  efficacy to microdosing  like microdosing with psilocybin or  microdosing with lsd or microdosing with  san pedro or boga or whatever not only  for workouts and exercise but for  productivity for creativity for kind of  like merging of the left and right brain  hemispheric activity that allows for you  to think in different ways than you  might have otherwise and even  neurogenesis right the growth of new  neurons which particularly happens with  uh with psilocybin  and and for some people the ego  dissolution or the personal  uh professional or spiritual  breakthroughs that can occur with larger  doses on an infrequent basis like you  know some people go to an ayahuasca  journey or others will you know use a  higher dose of psilocybin um or you know  a whole combination of different plant  medicine compounds that can also be  pretty transformative the problem is  a lot of people will use that like  as an escape  um to just kind of kind of check out you  know take a whole bunch of psilocybin  and just lose control your body and  float off into bliss for a while to  escape the pain of life that you should  be confronting head on and dealing with  in other ways or  they are um they're not doing the work  what's called the integration work  afterwards you know for me if i do a  plant medicine journey i have like four  o